      "voice_direction": "Warm, reflective feminine voice with neutral-to-Australian English. Intimate and vulnerable, with restrained emotion and unhurried pacing. Memories of Ibu are softer and slightly more distant. Build tension gradually during the journey to the dangerous place. Never caricature an animal or use a comic ape voice.",
